OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fa few showers at first in the evening.
OL,7,FMore widespread low cloud and
OL,8,Fpersistent rain moving in after
OL,9,Fmidnight. While mostly light, there is
OL,10,Fa chance for a spell of heavier rain
OL,11,Fin the southeast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FThe rain and low cloud
OL,14,Flingering, only clearing to the
OL,15,Fsoutheast early afternoon. Then
OL,16,Fbecoming fine and dry with sunny
OL,17,Fspells, and coastal showers developing
OL,18,Fin the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
