OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FFine
OL,6,Fday Thursday after a chilly start with
OL,7,Frural frost, before rain and stronger
OL,8,Fwinds spread east overnight. Windy
OL,9,FFriday and Saturday, with brighter
OL,10,Fspells but also outbreaks of rain.
